<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>terminal on Zellij</title><link>https://zellij.dev/tags/terminal/</link><description>Recent content in terminal on Zellij</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><copyright>This work is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International License.</copyright><lastBuildDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://zellij.dev/tags/terminal/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Zellij 0.46: built-in terminal, attention inbox, session previews</title><link>https://zellij.dev/news/terminal-inbox-session-previews/</link><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://zellij.dev/news/terminal-inbox-session-previews/</guid><description>&lt;figure class="video"&gt;&lt;video src="https://zellij.dev/video/version-046-intro.mp4#t=0.1" controls preload="metadata" playsinline&gt;&lt;/video&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Zellij 0.46.0 has just been released! &lt;a href="https://github.com/zellij-org/zellij/releases/tag/v0.46.0"&gt;Check it out!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Some highlights:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#built-in-terminal"&gt;Built-in Terminal (!!)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#attention-inbox"&gt;Attention Inbox&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#session-previews"&gt;Session Previews&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#settings-screen"&gt;Settings Screen&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#right-click-menu-and-improved-mouse-handling"&gt;Right-Click Menu and Improved Mouse Handling&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#theme-editor"&gt;Theme Editor&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#distributions-run-zellij-as-a-library"&gt;Distributions (run Zellij as a library)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#horizontal-stacks"&gt;Horizontal Stacks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#allow-temporarily-hiding-the-ui"&gt;Allow (temporarily) Hiding the UI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#whats-next"&gt;What&amp;rsquo;s next?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#please-support-the-zellij-developer-"&gt;Please Support the Zellij Developer&lt;/a&gt; ❤️&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="built-in-terminal"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#built-in-terminal"&gt;Built-in Terminal&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;figure&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;img class="img-dark" src="https://zellij.dev/img/terminal-desktop-preview.png" alt="A preview of the Zellij terminal window" width="900px;"&gt;&lt;img class="img-light" src="https://zellij.dev/img/terminal-desktop-preview-light.png" alt="A preview of the Zellij terminal window" width="900px;"&gt;&#10;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Zellij has always been and will always be a terminal multiplexer first. Now, it also includes a built-in terminal for those who want a more complete experience.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>